<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  The seller home-screen widget — "morning briefing" card.

  ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
  ⚠️  RemoteViews rules apply here, and they are much stricter than a normal
      Android layout. This tree is inflated by the LAUNCHER's process, so it
      may only use views from a fixed allowlist: LinearLayout, FrameLayout,
      RelativeLayout, GridLayout, TextView, ImageView, Button, ProgressBar,
      Chronometer. A ConstraintLayout here compiles, installs, and then shows
      "Problem loading widget" on the user's home screen with the only clue in
      logcat. That is not hypothetical — a plain <View> divider did exactly
      that in this feature's first build. `RemoteViewsSafetyTest` now fails the
      build's test suite if any element here is off that list, so add the
      element only if the test allows it.
  ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

  ── The design, and the four problems it fixes ──────────────────────────

  Measured against the first working version on a real P30 Pro launcher:

  1. **Ragged columns.** The counters were two rows of DIFFERENT cell counts
     (three then two), each cell weighted equally — so "0 custom" and "4 unread"
     started at unrelated x positions and the block read as broken alignment.
     Now it is six cells in a strict 3 × 2 grid: every column lines up because
     every cell has the same weight and the same pill geometry.

  2. **~40% dead space.** Content was top-stacked in a `match_parent` card, so a
     launcher that granted more height than the content needed left a void at
     the bottom. The grid now carries `layout_weight="1"` with vertical centring,
     so it absorbs exactly the leftover height at any tile size and the footer
     is the last thing, not a floating line in the middle.

  3. **Emphasis pointing the wrong way.** Every count was bold rust — including
     the zeros, so a quiet store shouted. Counts are now coloured by the Kotlin
     provider from their own value: zeros take the muted tone, and only a
     non-zero queue takes its semantic colour. The number that matters is the
     only one that is loud.

  4. **Type with no scale.** Sizes were 9/11/13/26sp — arbitrary, and the 9sp
     labels were below the 12sp readability floor. The scale is now
     **12 / 16 / 20 / 32**: one step per role (label, heading, stat, hero), so
     hierarchy is legible rather than merely present.

  ── Two things deliberately NOT here ─────────────────────────────────────

  * **No icons.** Compound drawables with vector resources are legal in
    RemoteViews, but an icon must then be authored per metric in both themes
    and cannot be verified from a desk. Coloured counts over written labels
    carry the same meaning with less to go wrong — and per the skill's own
    Color-Only rule, a colour must never be the *sole* signal, so the label is
    required regardless.
  * **No `android:alpha` on text.** Alpha tints the text toward whatever is
    behind it, which defeats the contrast ratios the colours were chosen for.
    Every tone here is a value chosen to clear 4.5:1, not a transparency.

  All strings are @string resources (placeholders here, overwritten by
  SellerWidgetProvider.kt) because RemoteViews cannot format or pluralise.
-->
<LinearLayout xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"
    android:id="@+id/widget_root"
    android:layout_width="match_parent"
    android:layout_height="match_parent"
    android:background="@drawable/seller_widget_bg"
    android:orientation="vertical"
    android:padding="16dp">

    <!-- ══ Populated: a signed-in seller with a store ══ -->
    <LinearLayout
        android:id="@+id/widget_content"
        android:layout_width="match_parent"
        android:layout_height="match_parent"
        android:orientation="vertical">

        <!-- ── Header: identity left, freshness right ── -->
        <LinearLayout
            android:layout_width="match_parent"
            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
            android:gravity="center_vertical"
            android:orientation="horizontal">

            <!-- 3dp rust bar — the app's mark, and the header's left edge.
                 A FrameLayout, never a <View>: see the header note. -->
            <FrameLayout
                android:layout_width="3dp"
                android:layout_height="20dp"
                android:background="@drawable/seller_widget_accent_bar" />

            <TextView
                android:id="@+id/widget_store_name"
                android:layout_width="0dp"
                android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                android:layout_marginStart="8dp"
                android:layout_weight="1"
                android:ellipsize="end"
                android:maxLines="1"
                android:text="@string/seller_widget_placeholder_store"
                android:textColor="@color/seller_widget_title"
                android:textSize="16sp"
                android:textStyle="bold" />

            <!-- The clock is formatted in Dart and read verbatim — RemoteViews
                 cannot format, and the payload already carries the string. -->
            <TextView
                android:id="@+id/widget_updated"
                android:layout_width="wrap_content"
                android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                android:layout_marginStart="8dp"
                android:maxLines="1"
                android:text="@string/seller_widget_placeholder_updated"
                android:textColor="@color/seller_widget_label"
                android:textSize="12sp" />
        </LinearLayout>

        <!-- ── Hero: today's takings, the number the tile exists for ── -->
        <TextView
            android:id="@+id/widget_revenue_caption"
            android:layout_width="match_parent"
            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
            android:layout_marginTop="14dp"
            android:letterSpacing="0.12"
            android:text="@string/seller_widget_today"
            android:textAllCaps="true"
            android:textColor="@color/seller_widget_label"
            android:textSize="12sp" />

        <TextView
            android:id="@+id/widget_revenue"
            android:layout_width="match_parent"
            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
            android:layout_marginTop="2dp"
            android:maxLines="1"
            android:text="@string/seller_widget_placeholder_value"
            android:textColor="@color/seller_widget_revenue"
            android:textSize="32sp"
            android:textStyle="bold" />

        <!-- ── The grid. weight=1 so it absorbs the tile's leftover height at
             ANY size the launcher grants, instead of leaving a void below. ── -->
        <LinearLayout
            android:id="@+id/widget_grid"
            android:layout_width="match_parent"
            android:layout_height="0dp"
            android:layout_marginTop="12dp"
            android:layout_weight="1"
            android:gravity="center_vertical"
            android:orientation="vertical">

            <!-- Row 1 — the three queues that need the seller's hands. -->
            <LinearLayout
                android:layout_width="match_parent"
                android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                android:orientation="horizontal">

                <!-- Cell: count over label, inside a tinted pill. Each of the
                     six is identical in weight and padding — that uniformity is
                     what makes the columns align. -->
                <LinearLayout
                    android:layout_width="0dp"
                    android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                    android:layout_margin="3dp"
                    android:layout_weight="1"
                    android:background="@drawable/seller_widget_pill"
                    android:orientation="vertical"
                    android:padding="10dp">

                    <TextView
                        android:id="@+id/widget_orders"
                        android:layout_width="match_parent"
                        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                        android:maxLines="1"
                        android:text="@string/seller_widget_placeholder_value"
                        android:textColor="@color/seller_widget_muted"
                        android:textSize="20sp"
                        android:textStyle="bold" />

                    <TextView
                        android:layout_width="match_parent"
                        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                        android:maxLines="1"
                        android:text="@string/seller_widget_orders"
                        android:textColor="@color/seller_widget_label"
                        android:textSize="12sp" />
                </LinearLayout>

                <LinearLayout
                    android:layout_width="0dp"
                    android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                    android:layout_margin="3dp"
                    android:layout_weight="1"
                    android:background="@drawable/seller_widget_pill"
                    android:orientation="vertical"
                    android:padding="10dp">

                    <TextView
                        android:id="@+id/widget_customs"
                        android:layout_width="match_parent"
                        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                        android:maxLines="1"
                        android:text="@string/seller_widget_placeholder_value"
                        android:textColor="@color/seller_widget_muted"
                        android:textSize="20sp"
                        android:textStyle="bold" />

                    <TextView
                        android:layout_width="match_parent"
                        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                        android:maxLines="1"
                        android:text="@string/seller_widget_custom"
                        android:textColor="@color/seller_widget_label"
                        android:textSize="12sp" />
                </LinearLayout>

                <LinearLayout
                    android:layout_width="0dp"
                    android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                    android:layout_margin="3dp"
                    android:layout_weight="1"
                    android:background="@drawable/seller_widget_pill"
                    android:orientation="vertical"
                    android:padding="10dp">

                    <TextView
                        android:id="@+id/widget_holdings"
                        android:layout_width="match_parent"
                        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                        android:maxLines="1"
                        android:text="@string/seller_widget_placeholder_value"
                        android:textColor="@color/seller_widget_muted"
                        android:textSize="20sp"
                        android:textStyle="bold" />

                    <TextView
                        android:layout_width="match_parent"
                        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                        android:maxLines="1"
                        android:text="@string/seller_widget_holds"
                        android:textColor="@color/seller_widget_label"
                        android:textSize="12sp" />
                </LinearLayout>
            </LinearLayout>

            <!-- Row 2 — requests, restock, unread. Same three cells as row 1, so
                 the columns align; the first version's two-cell row is exactly
                 what made it look broken. -->
            <LinearLayout
                android:layout_width="match_parent"
                android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                android:layout_marginTop="6dp"
                android:orientation="horizontal">

                <LinearLayout
                    android:layout_width="0dp"
                    android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                    android:layout_margin="3dp"
                    android:layout_weight="1"
                    android:background="@drawable/seller_widget_pill"
                    android:orientation="vertical"
                    android:padding="10dp">

                    <!-- Previously written by Dart and never displayed: the
                         payload has carried `pendingReservations` since the
                         first build, and the layout had no cell for it. -->
                    <TextView
                        android:id="@+id/widget_requests"
                        android:layout_width="match_parent"
                        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                        android:maxLines="1"
                        android:text="@string/seller_widget_placeholder_value"
                        android:textColor="@color/seller_widget_muted"
                        android:textSize="20sp"
                        android:textStyle="bold" />

                    <TextView
                        android:layout_width="match_parent"
                        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                        android:maxLines="1"
                        android:text="@string/seller_widget_requests"
                        android:textColor="@color/seller_widget_label"
                        android:textSize="12sp" />
                </LinearLayout>

                <LinearLayout
                    android:layout_width="0dp"
                    android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                    android:layout_margin="3dp"
                    android:layout_weight="1"
                    android:background="@drawable/seller_widget_pill"
                    android:orientation="vertical"
                    android:padding="10dp">

                    <TextView
                        android:id="@+id/widget_low_stock"
                        android:layout_width="match_parent"
                        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                        android:maxLines="1"
                        android:text="@string/seller_widget_placeholder_value"
                        android:textColor="@color/seller_widget_muted"
                        android:textSize="20sp"
                        android:textStyle="bold" />

                    <TextView
                        android:layout_width="match_parent"
                        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                        android:maxLines="1"
                        android:text="@string/seller_widget_low_stock"
                        android:textColor="@color/seller_widget_label"
                        android:textSize="12sp" />
                </LinearLayout>

                <LinearLayout
                    android:layout_width="0dp"
                    android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                    android:layout_margin="3dp"
                    android:layout_weight="1"
                    android:background="@drawable/seller_widget_pill"
                    android:orientation="vertical"
                    android:padding="10dp">

                    <TextView
                        android:id="@+id/widget_unread"
                        android:layout_width="match_parent"
                        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                        android:maxLines="1"
                        android:text="@string/seller_widget_placeholder_value"
                        android:textColor="@color/seller_widget_muted"
                        android:textSize="20sp"
                        android:textStyle="bold" />

                    <TextView
                        android:layout_width="match_parent"
                        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                        android:maxLines="1"
                        android:text="@string/seller_widget_unread"
                        android:textColor="@color/seller_widget_label"
                        android:textSize="12sp" />
                </LinearLayout>
            </LinearLayout>
        </LinearLayout>
    </LinearLayout>

    <!-- ══ Empty: no seller signed in on this device, or no store yet ══ -->
    <LinearLayout
        android:id="@+id/widget_empty"
        android:layout_width="match_parent"
        android:layout_height="match_parent"
        android:gravity="center"
        android:orientation="vertical"
        android:visibility="gone">

        <LinearLayout
            android:layout_width="wrap_content"
            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
            android:gravity="center_vertical"
            android:orientation="horizontal">

            <FrameLayout
                android:layout_width="3dp"
                android:layout_height="20dp"
                android:background="@drawable/seller_widget_accent_bar" />

            <TextView
                android:layout_width="wrap_content"
                android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                android:layout_marginStart="8dp"
                android:text="@string/seller_widget_empty_title"
                android:textColor="@color/seller_widget_title"
                android:textSize="16sp"
                android:textStyle="bold" />
        </LinearLayout>

        <TextView
            android:layout_width="wrap_content"
            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
            android:layout_marginTop="8dp"
            android:gravity="center"
            android:text="@string/seller_widget_empty_body"
            android:textColor="@color/seller_widget_muted"
            android:textSize="12sp" />
    </LinearLayout>
</LinearLayout>
